<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain to build $18.5 million golf course.</title>
<headline>Bahrain to build $18.5 million golf course.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Bahraini firm said on Sunday it would build a seven million dinar ($18.5 million) golf course on the Gulf Arab island, the country's first 18-hole course.</p>
<p>The Bahrain International Golf Course Company said in a statement it had signed the deal with A.A. Nass Contracting of Bahrain.</p>
<p>Work will begin this month and is expected to be completed by the end of 1998.</p>
<p>($1=0.377 dinars)</p>
